{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"screens\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"没有明确拼出负担的具体指向：他怕的是对方觉得自己需要亲近太多、会因此感到负担，而不是单纯存在某种心理负担。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"score\": 2,\n      \"wrong\": \"把‘几乎想把藏着的话全说出来’拼成了‘终于倾诉藏着的话’，误以为他已经说出口。完整稿恰恰强调他最后仍然有所保留，并没有把话全部说出来。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"score\": 2,\n      \"wrong\": \"把‘对方看出他有多在乎’拼成了‘他看见对方有多在乎’，在乎的主体和对象完全颠倒。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把‘他有点孤单’拼成了‘对方有些孤单’，弄错了感到孤单的人。另外，原文是他猜测对方会不会也舍不得结束亲近，不只是他自己舍不得。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把‘对方跟他在一起也能安心些’理解成了‘他因此更加安心’，弄错了安心的主体。原文强调的是对方可能也能从他这里获得安心。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"score\": 2,\n      \"wrong\": \"把‘对方不再需要他陪’反成了‘他不再需要对方陪’，需要关系的方向颠倒了；又把‘两人眼下还亲近、对方一直没退开，这些事实都是真的’理解成了那些不安的感受都是真的。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S14\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把‘不想再逼自己讨一句永远不变的保证’拼成了‘渴望永远不变的保证’，恰好把原文放下强求的态度说反了。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"story\": 3,\n  \"story_note\": \"全曲的情感发展主线基本相同，都是从小心克制、逐渐亲近，到坦然表达喜欢，又因害怕失去而挣扎，最后选择不再隐藏、不强求永远；但开头对负担的理解不够准确，且把几处需要与在乎的方向弄反，也把一度想说却没有说尽理解成已经倾诉，因此不能算完全同一件事。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "668e67d8-4937-4886-8750-18eebc4a4ed1", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T023226987595Z", "elapsed_seconds": 95.906, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:34:02.910882+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1877f73a1f39d53a2b5d048dcf04111380fc8d3cba9d6d322ad804057fe97c89", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T023226987595Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "287437acb95d23ed487f8f860e9d33e0b22c3008729132b1adf6ca12507519c0"}}}
